---

# 19. Important Research Context

The feature-engineered dataset is intended to support the proof-of-concept predictive analytics pipeline developed within the broader Digital Twin architecture.

The creation of telemetry features does not, by itself, establish:

- physical degradation measurements;
- Remaining Useful Life (RUL);
- machine-health states;
- failure prediction;
- validated predictive-maintenance capability.

The feature-engineering script explicitly does not create an `RUL_simulated` target. Any synthetic prognostic target is defined separately after examination of the session structure. :contentReference[oaicite:16]{index=16}

Accordingly, the datasets should be interpreted as supporting the technical implementation and experimental evaluation of a proof-of-concept predictive analytics pipeline.

